.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt EGGHEAD 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm egghead
.Nd a notebook that writes back
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -config Ar path
.Op Fl -server Ar host
.Op Fl -version
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Ar command Op Ar args ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a record-store-first multi-agent system on Elixir/OTP. Plain Markdown
records under a directory you choose are the substrate; agents are
participants in the graph, not owners of it. A SQLite index materializes
queries over the records. Agents are themselves records with
.Cm class: agent ;
their bodies are system prompts and their frontmatter declares the
model and capabilities they hold. External tools consult the whole
arrangement over MCP.
.Pp
Running
.Nm
with no command launches the terminal UI: a Notational
Velocity-style records browser, with an IRC-style chat room behind
.Cm /chat .
With no LLM provider configured the system gracefully degrades to a
record-store-only interface; reads keep working, anything that needs
to call a model returns a clean error.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "service"
.It Cm (default)
Launch the TUI.
.It Cm init
First-run setup wizard. Picks a records directory, configures LLM
providers, sets the default model, and offers to install the
background service.
.It Cm serve
Run the web UI and the MCP HTTP endpoint as a long-lived process.
.It Cm mcp
Speak the MCP protocol over stdin/stdout. Used by editor integrations.
.It Cm llm Op Cm list | add | remove | test | models
Manage LLM providers and inspect available models.
.It Cm agents Op Cm list | new | grant | revoke | capabilities
Manage agents (records with
.Cm class: agent )
and their held capabilities.
.It Cm skills Op Cm list | show | check
Inspect skills available to agents.
.It Cm tools Op Cm list | mcp ...
Inspect the agent tool catalog and configured MCP servers.
.It Cm rooms Op Cm list | new | drop | show
List, create, drop, or inspect chat rooms.
.It Cm eval Op Cm list | run | runs | report | compare
Run multi-agent evaluation tasks against a roster, grade with a
synthetic Judge agent, and persist a run record.
.It Cm config Op Cm set Ar key Ar value | path | show-cookie
View, edit, or print configuration paths.
.It Cm service Op Cm install | uninstall | status | logs
Install or remove a user-scope process supervisor for
.Cm egghead serve
(LaunchAgent on macOS, systemd user unit on Linux).
.It Cm doctor
Diagnose setup problems: configuration, records directory, index,
NIF binary, web port, log file, sandbox backend, providers, and
capability hygiene across all agents.
.It Cm logs
Tail the application log.
.It Cm help Op Ar command
Print top-level help, or help for a single command.
.El
.Pp
Every command accepts
.Fl h
or
.Fl -help
for command-specific help.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--server host"
.It Fl -config Ar path
Override the configuration file location for this invocation.
Equivalent to setting
.Ev EGGHEAD_CONFIG .
.It Fl -server Ar host
Attach to an
.Cm egghead serve
running on
.Ar host
over BEAM distribution. Equivalent to setting
.Ev EGGHEAD_SERVER .
The TUI, MCP stdio server, and most read-side commands work as a
client of that node when this is set.
.It Fl -version
Print the version string and exit. The version is computed at compile
time from the current date and the git SHA
.Pq for example, Sy 2026.4.14+61d171a .
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print help.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY"
.It Ev EGGHEAD_CONFIG
Path to the configuration file. May point at a directory (in which
case
.Pa config.yml
inside it is read) or directly at a YAML file.
.It Ev EGGHEAD_SERVER
Hostname of an
.Cm egghead serve
to attach to. Same effect as
.Fl -server .
.It Ev EGGHEAD_RECORDS
Override the records directory for this invocation. The TUI also
honors
.Ev EGGHEAD_RECORDS_DIR
for the same purpose.
.It Ev XDG_CONFIG_HOME , Ev XDG_STATE_HOME
Honored when locating the configuration file and the log file.
.It Ev ANTHROPIC_API_KEY , Ev OPENAI_API_KEY , Ev GOOGLE_API_KEY , ...
Provider API keys. When set, providers are auto-detected at startup
even if no explicit
.Cm llm:
entry exists in the configuration file. See
.Xr egghead 5
for the full list of recognized variables.
.It Ev SECRET_KEY_BASE
Used by the web server to sign session cookies. Set this when binding
beyond loopback.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "~/.local/state/egghead/egghead.log"
.It Pa ~/.config/egghead/config.yml
Configuration file. See
.Xr egghead 5 .
.It Pa ~/.egghead/
Default records directory.
.It Pa ~/.egghead/.egghead/index.db
Derived SQLite index. Rebuilt from the source files at any time.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/egghead/egghead.log
Application log file.
.It Pa ~/.erlang.cookie
BEAM distribution cookie. Required at the same path on every host
that participates in cross-host attach.
.It Pa .mcp.json
Project-local MCP client configuration that wires
.Cm egghead mcp
into editor integrations like Claude Code.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Launch the TUI:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead
.Ed
.Pp
First-run setup, then add an agent:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead init
egghead agents new
.Ed
.Pp
Run the web and MCP HTTP server on a non-default port:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead serve --port 8080
.Ed
.Pp
Attach to a tailnet-reachable node:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
EGGHEAD_SERVER=orca.tailnet.ts.net egghead
egghead --server orca.tailnet.ts.net rooms list
.Ed
